      "content": "exposureStart is optional in the accepted reconciliation, but storedDocument removes the previous value and this put omits it when the caller does not supply one. Consequently, an otherwise accepted Position Change can erase an existing exposureStart, causing that Open Trade to disappear from all cutoff queries. Require a non-null exposureStart for Position Change reconciliations and reject missing values before staging, while retaining the optional form for Plan confirmations.",
